---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Gantry // Harness-Neutral Agentic SDLC"
  description="Deterministic agentic SDLC skill pack. Turning living specs into verified software deliveries inside your coding harness."
>
  <div class="space-y-16 py-8">
    <!-- Hero Shell -->
    <section class="border border-obsidian-700 bg-obsidian-850/80 p-8 md:p-12 relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-amber-glow/5 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      
      <!-- Top technical telemetry badge -->
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs text-amber-accent mb-6">
        <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 bg-amber-glow animate-pulse"></span>
        <span class="tracking-widest uppercase font-mono">SYSTEM READY // DETERMINISTIC PIPELINE ACTIVE</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-100 uppercase font-mono leading-tight">
        Harness-Neutral <br />
        <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-glow to-amber-accent">
          Agentic SDLC
        </span>
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-6 text-slate-400 max-w-2xl text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-mono">
        Gantry is a skill pack, not an execution engine. Workflow scripts decide readiness, acceptance, gates, and roadmap state; agents plan, implement, review, and refute; the operator holds approval authority.
      </p>

      <!-- Quick stats/tokens grid -->
      <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 border-t border-obsidian-700/80 pt-6">
        <div class="p-3 bg-obsidian-900/60 border border-obsidian-700">
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase">Architecture</div>
          <div class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-amber-glow mt-1">Skill Pack</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 bg-obsidian-900/60 border border-obsidian-700">
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase">Verification</div>
          <div class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-slate-200 mt-1">Adversarial Critic</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 bg-obsidian-900/60 border border-obsidian-700">
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase">Gates</div>
          <div class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-slate-200 mt-1">Differential RFC6901</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 bg-obsidian-900/60 border border-obsidian-700">
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase">Harnesses</div>
          <div class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-amber-accent mt-1">Codex / Claude / AGY</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Pipeline Shell Anchor -->
    <section id="pipeline" class="border border-obsidian-700 bg-obsidian-850/50 p-6 md:p-8">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-obsidian-700 pb-4 mb-6">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100 uppercase tracking-wide">
            Pipeline Simulator
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Deterministic execution stages from Spec to Verified Delivery</p>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 bg-obsidian-800 text-amber-accent border border-obsidian-700">
          STAGE MONITOR
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs font-mono">
        <div class="p-4 bg-obsidian-900 border border-obsidian-700">
          <div class="text-amber-glow font-bold mb-1">01. PREFLIGHT & SPEC</div>
          <p class="text-slate-400">spec.py structural check & Requirement Critic evaluation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-obsidian-900 border border-obsidian-700">
          <div class="text-amber-glow font-bold mb-1">02. TDD & REVIEW</div>
          <p class="text-slate-400">Isolated worktree implementer with two-axis standards & spec review.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-obsidian-900 border border-obsidian-700">
          <div class="text-amber-glow font-bold mb-1">03. CRITIC & GATES</div>
          <p class="text-slate-400">Adversarial verification and serial integration gate validation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Skills Pack Shell Anchor -->
    <section id="skills" class="border border-obsidian-700 bg-obsidian-850/50 p-6 md:p-8">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-obsidian-700 pb-4 mb-6">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100 uppercase tracking-wide">
            The Three Skills
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Modular agent skills for repository lifecycle</p>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 bg-obsidian-800 text-amber-accent border border-obsidian-700">
          PACK RIG
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-5 bg-obsidian-900 border border-obsidian-700 hover:border-amber-glow/50 transition-colors">
          <div class="text-amber-glow font-bold text-sm">gantry</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2">The core workflow skill executing planning, implementation, review, and critic loops.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 bg-obsidian-900 border border-obsidian-700 hover:border-amber-glow/50 transition-colors">
          <div class="text-amber-glow font-bold text-sm">gantry-setup</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2">Conversational repository onboarding and configuration manager.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 bg-obsidian-900 border border-obsidian-700 hover:border-amber-glow/50 transition-colors">
          <div class="text-amber-glow font-bold text-sm">gantry-dashboard</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2">Loopback-only, read-only multi-run kanban observer.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Harness Matrix Anchor -->
    <section id="matrix" class="border border-obsidian-700 bg-obsidian-850/50 p-6 md:p-8">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-obsidian-700 pb-4 mb-6">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100 uppercase tracking-wide">
            Harness Compatibility
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Honest support tiers across agent execution environments</p>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 bg-obsidian-800 text-amber-accent border border-obsidian-700">
          TIER MATRIX
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-left text-xs font-mono">
          <thead class="bg-obsidian-900 text-slate-400 border-b border-obsidian-700">
            <tr>
              <th class="p-3">Harness</th>
              <th class="p-3">Tier</th>
              <th class="p-3">Hooks Support</th>
              <th class="p-3">Role Execution</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-obsidian-700">
            <tr class="bg-obsidian-900/40">
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-200 font-bold">Claude Code</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-amber-glow">Reference</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-300">Native Settings + Hooks</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-300">Full Multi-Role</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-obsidian-900/40">
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-200 font-bold">Antigravity</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-amber-glow">Supported</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-300">.agents/hooks.json Guard</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-300">Subagents & agy --print</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-obsidian-900/40">
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-200 font-bold">Codex CLI</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-amber-accent">Supported</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-300">Direct Process Runner</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-300">Independent Critic / Roles</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-obsidian-900/40">
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-200 font-bold">OpenCode</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-400">Compatible</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-300">Plugin Hooks Wiring</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-300">Per-role subagents</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
